{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1000_p", "source_sha256": "deac68f1f1810c3af09ac8e5beb9b1db91bac787d3e415d66c6b2a53d700f22e", "ja": "（音楽特番の生放送まで、あとわずか。貴音と雪歩が\nペアで司会をすることが、正式に決定した）", "zh": "（距离音乐特别节目直播只剩一点时间。贵音和雪步搭档主持一事，终于正式确定了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fdc3d435f92020450565fe08826e67eef6ab0ff93de62f080620c631951431b0", "ja": "本日披露するのは、話題のドラマの……。", "zh": "今天要为大家介绍的是，热门电视剧的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1002_p", "source_sha256": "056e260d7a2bcd82ef467c43991bc12da61077f5c3ef3a713187967fce67a02e", "ja": "（……ん？　屋上から声が？）", "zh": "（……嗯？屋顶上传来声音？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6b0bf1c9f8a0a5caa0e5e4daa75163a4f98cf55bef6feadd3fae77aa3ba104d6", "ja": "今後の活動も楽しみですね♪　それでは……\n……えっと、映像が流れてる間に次の準備をして。", "zh": "期待接下来的活动呢♪ 那么……\n……那个，趁影像播放的时候，准备一下接下来的环节。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1004_p", "source_sha256": "91b3e5305b6ecb91f92cdc36d01c2ab1cd29dbe164981f5e246b02320132064c", "ja": "……雪歩？　お疲れ様。\n司会の準備、バッチリみたいだな！", "zh": "……雪步？辛苦了。\n主持的准备，看来很充分嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c244c7eadb4fa8d40cae4066c0b3e75258b8abc7f7d9e00000fa4b7a66e98fd2", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nうううっ、全然バッチリなんかじゃないですよぉ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n呜呜呜，才完全没有准备好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c4ed7a5a5ec119bac47bc3769fbfebf80fe27c86b4e07de2b85461bdc6760e50", "ja": "えっ。でも今、スムーズに喋れていたんじゃ……？", "zh": "咦？可是刚才不是还说得很流畅吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d8026bbc6bf6f0de1ebf354e10b7dff34c212008f201ee0df12bf5547f7c5474", "ja": "一人で練習してる間はいいんですけど、\n大勢の人の前で、失敗しちゃったらって思うと……。", "zh": "自己一个人练习的时候还好，可一想到要是在很多人面前失败了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5140e614d35934a152752147b68de0f01a1b5385c32f8b0b57ac38015bb5fc10", "ja": "もうドキドキしすぎて……このままだと本番で、\n心臓が止まるかもしれません～……。", "zh": "心跳得太厉害了……再这样下去，正式演出时心脏可能会停跳～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f75cc1c1dc525a820772433b10716559d1169ae4d56cc9553e7742076324237a", "ja": "それは困ったな……。生放送の超有名大型番組、\nしかも大勢の観客の前でそんな失敗を……。", "zh": "那可就麻烦了……在直播的超大型知名节目上，而且还是在众多观众面前犯那种错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "41e9da1c38aefe83f0faf7161274dc2cd89fae46d9a1de2fdd676917ca60257a", "ja": "ひっ……ひう……！", "zh": "呜……呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7afbff518d1cf23d54109049ea5091860b95ec7f234936dc34f0007dfbf219ec", "ja": "ああ、ごめんごめん。……そうだな、\nそんなに不安なら、一度貴音に相談してみたらどうだ？", "zh": "啊，抱歉抱歉。……这样吧，\n你要是那么不安，不如去找贵音商量一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "aa0236681f9d57a0d303d328efafd2fd014cddb958dda6bff53cbaf76a4aaccf", "ja": "えっ……。そ、それは無しです。私が四条さんの\n足を引っ張るわけにいきませんから……。", "zh": "诶……。不、不行。我不能拖四条小姐的后腿……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e6e3a775cde801d2057f31c0b227771f163abd6b2f8dfb350faa12978f05ccdb", "ja": "もっと一人で練習を積んで……四条さんの隣に立つ\n時には、少しでも自信を持てる私にならなくちゃ……！", "zh": "还要再一个人多加练习……等到站在四条小姐身边时，我一定要成为哪怕多一点自信的自己……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1014_p", "source_sha256": "382e48050897cd2592393c2c82646418e0f4dda3aa18de1c7ca8ba57f12a8ea3", "ja": "そこは遠慮しなくていいんじゃないかな。貴音も、\n春香も伊織も、きっと仲間の手を取りたいと思ってる。", "zh": "这方面不用顾虑吧。贵音、春香和伊织，肯定也都想向同伴伸出援手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4bad0db4f86140a2be13778d3155154971bf34033cf770c714e038adc8d4799a", "ja": "雪歩がそう思ったんだから。", "zh": "既然雪步是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a28d051b464c7b0266b98b3120042b3f8b67f1f932abb4e63104d1985ad0d4b6", "ja": "というわけで、たとえば……\nいっそ3人の前で練習してみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "所以说，比如……\n干脆在3人面前练习一下，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "41ef1473ba23287231371e1131cc2c9b42ca937c13becb2364ee0c29777ab0a1", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、それは……無理かもですぅ。\n一人で練習してても、まだ噛んじゃうのに……。", "zh": "诶！？　这、这个……可能做不到啦。\n明明一个人练习的时候，还是会咬字……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ebb59136d0213f822657a54ce8075bb113e7f8a974293b8b7e883d1d00a5ea5d", "ja": "みんなの前でなんて、きっと噛み噛みのボロボロに\nなって。余計に自信を失いそうで……。", "zh": "要是当着大家的面，肯定会不停吃螺丝、变得一塌糊涂的。\n感觉反而会更加失去自信……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1020_p", "source_sha256": "66255b568f06e0b8744db2cc751dc171c38d5185f79e706d27c30523becaccae", "ja": "仲間なんだし、気にするな。どんどん失敗して、\n逆に度胸をつけよう。その方が近道だと思う！", "zh": "既然是伙伴，就别在意了。尽管放手去失败，反而能锻炼胆量。我觉得那样才是捷径！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "41bde0b3cb7ad1cb7ebcb665f69c3799c5d09d53da27eff4e84be1d10f13fb41", "ja": "ち、近道……！　うう、わかりましたぁ……。\nじゃあ、私……みんなの前で失敗しまくってきますぅ！", "zh": "近、近道……！呜呜，我明白了……  \n那我……就去大家面前狠狠失败一通再回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0463_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9116a40958da43345f24a23494b082e02af98cb3661094f60f73de1482e3d6d2", "ja": "その代わり、噛んでも笑わないでくださいね？\n絶対、絶対ですからね！？", "zh": "不过，您可千万别笑话我说错哦？\n绝对、绝对不许笑哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
